Test files of dwo_attpreview_office (legacy binary formats)

legacy_sample.xls, legacy_sample.ppt, legacy_sample.doc, legacy_rejected.doc are unmodified copies of test data of
Apache POI (https://github.com/apache/poi, directory test-data), Copyright The Apache Software Foundation,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt in this folder).

| Here                 | Apache POI path                              |
|----------------------|----------------------------------------------|
| legacy_sample.xls    | test-data/spreadsheet/SimpleChart.xls        |
| legacy_sample.ppt    | test-data/slideshow/bullets.ppt              |
| legacy_sample.doc    | test-data/document/Lists.doc                 |
| legacy_rejected.doc  | test-data/document/table-merges.doc          |

They are used only by the automated tests. legacy_rejected.doc (merged table cells) is a file the legacy add-on
refuses on purpose ("unsupported-content"): the tests check that the dialog shows a short message and a Download
button. sample.xlsx, sample.docx, sample.pptx and long.docx are generated by this project.

sample.csv, sample_semicolon.csv (with a UTF-8 byte order mark) and sample.tsv are generated by this project (fictional
data, Vietnamese text, a quoted comma, a long line, a leading zero, text that looks like a formula).
